commit 346e930f0b6c046252838b68c4f06a18d6fe9b49

C03: a dated machine report reads the clock and then the named status scope (SYSTEM1367)

«Muestra la fecha actual y el uso de RAM del sistema» and «Muestra la fecha y hora actual del sistema y el espacio libre en disco C:» resolved to system.status alone and lost the date; the bounded status sequence only accepts requests with two ordering markers (primero/después).

effect_intent._dated_machine_report: a show/tell head, the date (optionally with the time) and one measurable machine scope joined by «y/and» is the read-only plan system.time then system.status; the existing scope readers ground memory or disk; prohibitions, hypotheticals and other devices stay out. resolve_explicit_effects proposes it before the bounded sequence.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


